      "writtenOn": "2026-09-24T16:04:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This affects the response to `EC_CMD_BATTERY_CONFIG` since you\u0027ve added a field to `struct fuel_gauge_info`, the layout of `struct board_batt_params` (see line 8362 below) has changed. Because `fuel_gauge` comes before `batt_info`, the offsets for all battery constants in the host command response have shifted.\n\nYou must increment `EC_BATTERY_CONFIG_STRUCT_VERSION` to 0x01 so that host-side tools (like ectool) can detect the layout change and parse the response correctly.",
      "parentUuid": "b738aa3e_f9fab9f2",
